Description: Estimates the variance components of one- and two-facet
    generalizability (G) studies with crossed or nested designs, and computes
    decision (D) studies with random, finite, or fixed facets. Reports standard
    errors for variance components, error variances, and generalizability and
    dependability coefficients. D studies can be compared across sample sizes
    and selected by a minimum G or Phi value.
